Student data
------------

This extension reads a student's own Canvas coursework and transmits it to
Ethyra for analysis. That is education data subject to FERPA, and it is a
material difference from upstream, which sends nothing anywhere.

What is read:

    the student's own submissions      files and typed text, every attempt
    assignment instructions            as the instructor wrote them, verbatim
    rubric definitions                 the criteria, not how anyone was marked
    instruction attachments            files linked from those instructions
    dates                              due date and submission date
    the student's own marks            score, letter grade, points possible,
                                       per gradebook item, sent only for a
                                       course with at least one submission —
                                       shown on the class window, never put in
                                       a prompt
    course identity                    name, code and term; the student's name
    course structure                   per course with submitted work, as the
                                       student sees it: syllabus, modules and
                                       their items (titles, types, due dates,
                                       locked ones included), published pages,
                                       quiz metadata (title, description, due
                                       date, question count — never questions
                                       or answers), outcome titles and
                                       descriptions, and document-type course
                                       files (no media), sent only by per-file
                                       upload (ethyra/structure.js)

What is not read — enforced at the Canvas request rather than by a filter
afterwards, so no later change can forget it:

    instructor comments                the feedback thread on a submission
    rubric marks                       how an instructor scored the student
    class statistics                   mean, median and quartiles
    quiz questions and answers         only the quiz list is read
    discussions and announcements      not requested
    video, audio and other media       never sent

`score_statistics`, `submission_comments` and `rubric_assessment` are never
asked for, and `ethyra/manifest.js` has no field to carry them if they arrived.
`ethyra/wiring.test.mjs` fails if either changes.

LEGAL.md is the student-facing version of this list and must agree with it.
